<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS4" title="In Appendix C ADDITIONAL FINANCIAL QUALITATIVE EXAMPLES ‣ Beyond the Black Box: Interpretability of Agentic AI Tool Use" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.4 </span>Full per-step probe tables</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
